# ==============================================================================
# JANAVANI SYSTEM MANAGEMENT SCHEDULE TEMPLATE (CRONTAB)
# Installs an automated trigger configuration inside the host system clock scheduler.
# ==============================================================================

# Triggers the automated backup script every single day at exactly 02:00 AM UTC
